B.aG2=s(["Ofr\xe8 sa a ap aplike apre 7 jou es\xe8 gratis la. Ou ka chanje l nenp\xf2t ki l\xe8.","Cette offre s\u2019appliquera apr\xe8s l\u2019essai gratuit de 7 jours. Vous pourrez la changer \xe0 tout moment.","This plan applies after the free 7-day trial. You can change it anytime."],t.s)
B.bdI=s(["Verifye ak konfime","V\xe9rifier et confirmer","Review and confirm"],t.s)
B.atr=s(["L\xe8 w klike, w dak\xf2 ak kondisyon itilizasyon yo. Es\xe8 a fini apre 7 jou si w pa peye; done ou rete disponib pou eksp\xf2tasyon.","En cliquant, vous acceptez les conditions d\u2019utilisation. L\u2019essai se termine apr\xe8s 7 jours sans paiement ; vos donn\xe9es restent exportables.","By clicking, you accept the terms of use. The trial ends after 7 days without payment; your data remains exportable."],t.s)
